    "description": "Natural Amethyst Quartz Crystal Cluster Lot\nRough Mineral Specimens, 4 Pieces\nNatural Geode and Druzy Formations, Brazil\nThis collection features four natural raw amethyst and quartz crystal specimens showcasing distinct geological crystal habits and coloration. Sourced from crystalline basalt geode deposits, these specimens display varied shades ranging from delicate lilac to deeper violet druzy terminated points resting on natural matrix bases.\nItems Included:\nElongated quartz and light amethyst druzy cluster on dark basalt matrix with \"Made in Brazil\" label\nLavender botryoidal druzy cluster formation with subtle amber-toned quartz center\nUpright amethyst cluster featuring distinct pyramidal crystal terminations on rough matrix\nSliced geode section displaying violet amethyst crystallization edged in white quartz\nCondition:\nAll specimens are in natural rough state with naturally occurring crystalline terminations, surface texture, and matrix rock intact. Natural fractured edges, matrix variations, and mineral inclusions are present throughout as expected with raw earth stones. Original country of origin sticker remains affixed to one specimen.\nAll items are sold as-is. Condition, completeness, and functionality may vary. Items may not be fully tested, authenticated, sorted, or inventoried unless explicitly stated in the listing. For bulk, lot, or miscellaneous listings, contents can include a mix of brands, types, and conditions, and there are no guarantees regarding specific items included.\nAutographs and signatures have not been authenticated unless otherwise noted.\nWatches and electronics may not be tested for full functionality and may only be tested for power on, if at all.\nDue to the nature of these items, no returns or refunds will be accepted for condition, completeness, or functionality. Buyers are responsible for reviewing all photos and descriptions and must address any questions or concerns prior to bidding or purchase. By placing a bid or completing a purchase, you agree to these terms.\nFor jewelry orders only:\nCombined shipping is available for multiple items but must be requested through customer service prior to completing payment. This process is not automatic, and no refunds will be issued for combined shipping after payment has been processed.\nPlease note:\nWhat is pictured is what is in the box/bag. As this is an assorted bulk jewelry items, there are no guarantees in regards to the items included and condition. This will contain some combination of mismatched, damaged, craft/costume jewelry, and accessories. Note that the auctions are typically shipped in bulk and not packaged individually. This auction is not available for closer examination or additional information or pictures beyond what has been disclosed. Coin lots have been sorted as to not contain any US coins or currency or non-monetary items. However, a few may be missed and could be included.\nNo returns or refunds will be accepted for this auction. By placing a bid on this auction, you accept this as a condition of the sale.\nOversized Prints, Paintings & Framed Artwork – Shipping Disclaimer\nSome oversized prints, paintings, and framed artwork may be listed as",
